erful gods face off in one-on-one battles against the strongest champions from human history — during a final struggle known as “Ragnarok.” The first team to win 7 out of 13 battles will be declared the winner, but it seems almost impossible for humans to win against the gods.\n\nAlthough the gods sneer at her declaration, Brunhild provokes them further:\n\n“Are you chickening out?”\n\nHer words hit the gods’ nerves, and, enraged, they accept her proposal. Now, Brunhild and her sisters must choose humanity’s 13 champions in a desperate battle for survival. Will humans surpass gods and prevent humanity’s ultimate end? The eschatological battles between heaven and earth finally begins!\n\n(Source: Warner Bros. Japan)"},"tags":[{"name":"Gods","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":87,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dissociative Identities","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Battle Royale","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":67,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Spearplay","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Samurai","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":38,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Record of Ragnarok","english":"Record of Ragnarok","native":"終末のワルキューレ","romaji":"Shuumatsu no Valkyrie","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"终末的女武神"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"S